		["Alliance town: Horde characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "联盟城镇：部落角色只需碰到其边缘（有卫兵）",
		["Horde town: Alliance characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "部落城镇：联盟角色只需碰到其边缘（有卫兵）",
